Glide Finance Frontend
======================

This application is a modified build of the Glide Finance frontend.

Original source: https://github.com/glide-finance/glide-frontend
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

Modifications for PC2 packaging:
- Added "homepage": "." to package.json for relative asset paths
- Resolved @babel/core version via yarn resolutions for CRA 4 build compatibility
- Downgraded @uniswap/token-lists to 1.0.0-beta.34 for pre-built dist availability
- Used react-app-rewired with config-overrides.js for .mjs transpilation
- Removed non-essential large decorative images (home/partners, nfts, etc.) to reduce bundle size
- Build environment: REACT_APP_CHAIN_ID=20, ESC RPC endpoints

The complete source code (including modifications) is available at:
https://github.com/glide-finance/glide-frontend

For the full license text, see the LICENSE file in this directory.
